      "updated": 1792851321871,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why not classic RAG?\nScore = recall + precision vs an exhaustive expert list.\nTop-k similarity misses generic obligations\n('The lamps shall be so designed…').\n→ exhaustive filter inside the chosen regulations;\nembeddings only to map product words → tags.",
      "originalText": "Why not classic RAG?\nScore = recall + precision vs an exhaustive expert list.\nTop-k similarity misses generic obligations\n('The lamps shall be so designed…').\n→ exhaustive filter inside the chosen regulations;\nembeddings only to map product words → tags.",
